WEBVTT

00:00.567 --> 00:09.424
kanashige ni saku hana ni kimi no omokage wo mita

00:00.567 --> 00:09.424
I saw your image in the flower that is blossoming sorrowfully

00:09.937 --> 00:18.509
daisuki na ame nanoni naze ka kyou wa tsumetakute

00:09.937 --> 00:18.509
I love rain, yet it felt frosty today

00:18.651 --> 00:37.226
kisetsu wa meguri mori wa somerare kaze wa kanadete omoi afurete

00:18.651 --> 00:37.226
The season changed, the forest was colored, the wind played a tune, memories overflowed

00:37.600 --> 00:46.786
tsuki no kakera wo atsumete yume wo kazari nemuru

00:37.600 --> 00:46.787
Gather the pieces of the moon, decorate the dream and sleep

00:47.020 --> 00:56.153
toki no suna chiribametemo ano koro e kaeranai

00:47.020 --> 00:56.154
Even if I sprinkle the sand of time, I cannot return to the past

00:56.313 --> 01:05.420
ikiru imi sageshiteiru dare mo mina tabibito

00:56.313 --> 01:05.420
Those searching for the meaning of life are all travellers

01:05.769 --> 01:14.817
haruka naru tabiji tadori boku wa ima arukidasu

01:05.776 --> 01:14.817
I set my course on this endless journey

01:14.837 --> 01:22.812
ibara no michi no mukou e...

01:14.837 --> 01:22.812
for the place beyond the thorny path...

01:25.745 --> 01:30.665
The artist of life who produces miracles
with his godlike scalpel skills.

01:31.584 --> 01:33.919
The surgeon whom the era has yearned for.

01:34.795 --> 01:35.838
Black Jack.

01:59.546 --> 02:00.933
Yes, come in.

02:01.601 --> 02:03.477
Um, Mother...

02:03.773 --> 02:05.106
Oh, it's okay.

02:05.107 --> 02:07.192
You have more patients?

02:07.610 --> 02:10.862
I was just thinking I wanted to go out.

02:11.405 --> 02:13.114
I'm sorry every time.

02:19.506 --> 02:21.373
How many days this time?

02:21.582 --> 02:26.086
Well, the next room should be
available in about three days.

02:26.295 --> 02:27.420
Is that so?

02:27.493 --> 02:28.123
OK.

02:29.090 --> 02:30.548
Oh, Mother,

02:30.841 --> 02:32.467
it's not much, but...

02:32.885 --> 02:34.427
Thanks again.

02:47.024 --> 02:50.204
Originally by Tezuka Osamu "Moraimizu"

02:47.024 --> 02:50.204
Moraimizu

02:50.277 --> 02:52.612
I'll race you to that bridge!

02:53.067 --> 02:55.444
Wait, Pinoco-chan!

03:11.388 --> 03:12.847
Owie...

03:12.848 --> 03:14.390
Hey! Largo!

03:14.391 --> 03:15.933
Don't stop so sudden...

03:16.059 --> 03:17.894
What's the matter?

03:19.813 --> 03:22.148
An old lady?

03:22.524 --> 03:24.442
What is she doing?

03:25.486 --> 03:26.736
Lady,

03:27.488 --> 03:28.905
what is that?

03:29.114 --> 03:30.198
This?

03:30.199 --> 03:32.617
It's called a kendama.

03:34.411 --> 03:37.163
It's a toy that kids used to play with years ago.

03:38.040 --> 03:41.042
The Japanese kendama was
developed during the 19th century...

03:41.376 --> 03:44.170
Why are you playing with a kendama alone?

03:44.588 --> 03:45.922
Why?

03:46.715 --> 03:48.174
I'm waiting...

03:51.595 --> 03:53.137
for the time to pass.

04:04.691 --> 04:07.193
Thank you, Doctor.

04:07.236 --> 04:08.319
Take care.

04:11.532 --> 04:15.034
Honey, Kubota-san is requesting
hospitalization for a thorough exam.

04:15.828 --> 04:17.412
Oh, man.

04:17.413 --> 04:20.248
I told Mom that the room would be available in three days,

04:20.249 --> 04:22.250
but with this many patients...

04:22.459 --> 04:26.712
Why don't we ask her to move into a rest home?

04:27.631 --> 04:30.819
How could her doctoral son send her to a place like that?

04:31.009 --> 04:33.052
We've discussed this before.

04:33.137 --> 04:34.345
But!

04:34.346 --> 04:39.559
You know how much it hurts to
have a room open just for her!

04:39.852 --> 04:42.397
Then would you let her stay with us?

04:42.455 --> 04:44.647
Not a chance! Never!

04:45.899 --> 04:47.775
Then would you tolerate the situation?

04:47.776 --> 04:49.777
But we need the room.

04:50.070 --> 04:57.493
That's why I give her money to stay
outside when time is critical

04:57.494 --> 04:59.787
so that the room is available.

05:02.458 --> 05:05.042
But the cost is significant too.

05:05.043 --> 05:07.712
The cost should be nothing!

05:07.713 --> 05:08.880
Well, fine.

05:08.881 --> 05:11.716
Would you think about our future, then?

05:12.009 --> 05:12.842
Here.

05:13.886 --> 05:15.136
Hey!

05:17.598 --> 05:21.434
See, you can make a kendama with these, too.

05:23.103 --> 05:24.520
Do you want to try?

05:28.025 --> 05:30.276
You suck.

05:31.445 --> 05:33.613
Shut up, Sharaku!

05:34.323 --> 05:35.282
You upset me!

05:35.449 --> 05:37.241
Now, see you later.

05:43.040 --> 05:44.499
Lady,

05:46.627 --> 05:49.128
Oh, children, is there something else?

05:49.213 --> 05:51.634
We'll walk with you as a thank you for this kendama.

05:51.780 --> 05:53.382
Largo agrees with us too.

05:54.468 --> 05:56.427
Really? Thank you.

06:00.140 --> 06:03.309
I'm sorry, but my wife is away right now.

06:03.477 --> 06:04.477
Oh, my.

06:04.478 --> 06:07.897
I thought we could catch up with each other.

06:07.898 --> 06:09.982
Excuse me then.

06:09.983 --> 06:12.610
Tell her that I said hello.

06:12.694 --> 06:15.738
Let's see, Suwa-san's house is...

06:24.623 --> 06:26.124
Excuse me.

06:26.792 --> 06:28.543
I'm sorry.

06:29.711 --> 06:30.962
I'm sorry.

06:32.673 --> 06:34.205
I see.

06:34.306 --> 06:37.427
That's why you stay with a friend of yours.

06:37.428 --> 06:40.263
I can't be a bother to my son.

06:42.391 --> 06:43.975
Oh. My lady.

06:44.268 --> 06:45.561
Long time no see.

06:46.072 --> 06:47.478
May I come in?

06:47.479 --> 06:51.065
Oh, I know it's been a while, but, well...

06:51.358 --> 06:52.525
A vacation!

06:52.526 --> 06:54.318
We're about to leave for a vacation.

06:54.319 --> 06:55.987
Mom, are we going on a vacation?

06:55.988 --> 06:57.155
Shhh! Quiet!

06:57.531 --> 07:01.576
Oh, my, I can watch the house for you.

07:01.618 --> 07:05.955
No, we're going to rent the place to another friend.

07:06.123 --> 07:07.832
I see.

07:07.833 --> 07:09.917
Mom, when are we going?

07:10.294 --> 07:11.252
Mom?

07:11.837 --> 07:13.379
Excuse me.

07:14.006 --> 07:16.098
Hey, that woman is here again.

07:16.300 --> 07:21.387
We've known her for a long time, but
she stays around for a long time.

07:21.388 --> 07:23.556
I can't have her stay here.

07:23.557 --> 07:25.183
You know how much of a bother
it is for her to stay with us?

07:25.184 --> 07:27.477
Even her family doesn't care about her?

07:27.519 --> 07:28.936
Poor woman.

07:35.694 --> 07:37.496
I'm done.

07:38.280 --> 07:38.988
Oh, my.

07:39.448 --> 07:40.990
Why don't you go home?

07:40.991 --> 07:42.575
The sun is setting.

07:44.036 --> 07:45.578
But you haven't found where...

07:45.579 --> 07:46.954
That's it!

07:46.955 --> 07:49.824
You can stay at my place!

07:50.709 --> 07:54.879
We live with a weirdo doctor, but I'm sure you'll like him!

07:54.880 --> 07:57.507
Or would you like to come to my place?

07:57.549 --> 08:00.885
See, I'll show you my proud figurine collection.

08:00.886 --> 08:03.679
My place would be more fun!

08:04.681 --> 08:05.640
No way!

08:05.641 --> 08:07.934
Sharaku! Don't talk back to me!

08:07.935 --> 08:10.394
But my place is closer.

08:10.395 --> 08:11.772
My place!

08:10.771 --> 08:13.731
Thank you, all.

08:13.732 --> 08:15.274
Would you take this?

08:17.027 --> 08:19.320
But isn't it important to you?

08:19.538 --> 08:20.663
It's okay.

08:20.664 --> 08:22.290
Take it to remember today.

08:22.291 --> 08:23.750
See you.

08:24.627 --> 08:27.712
Don't worry about me.

08:27.713 --> 08:30.465
I have many other friends.

08:40.476 --> 08:44.104
Let's see, from this bus stop...

08:50.653 --> 08:53.279
They're not home. Oh, bother.

08:55.241 --> 08:58.535
Oh my, there aren't any more buses.

08:58.577 --> 08:59.911
What do I do?

09:02.331 --> 09:02.914
Oh?

09:04.625 --> 09:05.792
Oh, oh.

09:06.794 --> 09:09.295
Now even the sky is crying.

09:36.488 --> 09:37.822
Lady, are you okay?!

09:38.824 --> 09:39.657
Did you get hurt?

09:40.659 --> 09:41.951
I'm fine.

09:41.994 --> 09:43.828
I was just startled.

09:43.829 --> 09:46.372
I'm sorry, I was spacing out.

09:46.540 --> 09:47.790
Please, get in the car.

09:48.334 --> 09:51.794
Then would you take me somewhere?

09:52.755 --> 09:53.588
Yes.

09:58.594 --> 10:00.345
Oh, there it is.

10:01.013 --> 10:02.805
Take that path left.

10:02.848 --> 10:03.396
Yes.

10:07.895 --> 10:11.397
Where are you trying to go, so deep in the mountains?

10:12.066 --> 10:15.777
There is a vacation home we used to use a long time ago.

10:15.819 --> 10:17.987
I thought I'd go there.

10:17.988 --> 10:21.908
Excuse me, but why would an old
lady like you go there so late?

10:22.284 --> 10:24.619
Besides, how are you going to get back?

10:24.620 --> 10:26.913
It will work out.

10:27.623 --> 10:30.166
Can't you stay at an inn or something?

10:30.668 --> 10:32.794
That's too much of a waste.

10:33.170 --> 10:34.671
Did you travel far?

10:34.838 --> 10:37.840
No, I live in the town we just left.

10:38.217 --> 10:40.176
Then why are you going to the vacation house?

10:40.177 --> 10:44.639
Well, my son is a doctor.

10:49.478 --> 10:50.895
How absurd!

10:51.689 --> 10:54.857
Lady, this reminds me of something.

10:55.984 --> 10:58.611
With the well bucket taken over by morning
glories, I go begging for water.

10:58.612 --> 10:59.988
It's a haiku.

11:00.656 --> 11:03.408
It's a poem about a person feeling bad about removing
the morning glory's ivy from the well bucket's rope,

11:03.617 --> 11:07.870
so the person goes to the neighbor's to borrow some water.

11:09.215 --> 11:11.416
Your room is taken over by patients,

11:11.417 --> 11:12.458
and now you need to borrow a room.

11:13.585 --> 11:16.879
But still, it's for my son's work.

11:17.381 --> 11:19.424
I can't help it.

11:23.887 --> 11:25.138
The road is blocked.

11:25.806 --> 11:27.974
We can't go on with a car.

11:28.308 --> 11:29.642
Is it really beyond this?

11:29.810 --> 11:30.727
Yes.

11:30.728 --> 11:32.603
It's an old vacation home, really.

11:32.604 --> 11:34.605
Thank you for the ride.

11:35.065 --> 11:36.315
What will you do now?

11:36.734 --> 11:38.067
Will you walk there?

11:38.485 --> 11:40.445
It's very close to here.

11:40.446 --> 11:42.071
Then I'll walk you there.

11:42.072 --> 11:45.742
Thank you, but I'll be fine.

11:45.743 --> 11:46.534
It's really close.

12:09.767 --> 12:11.976
It sure brings back memories.

12:23.238 --> 12:24.405
Mom!

12:24.907 --> 12:26.157
Mom!

12:29.912 --> 12:32.288
Look, I did it!

12:32.790 --> 12:34.290
Watch.

12:39.463 --> 12:41.673
That's good, Yuichi.

13:00.984 --> 13:02.068
Lady...

13:05.864 --> 13:07.073
Now the weather news.

13:07.074 --> 13:10.368
The entire Kanto area is under a flood watch.

13:10.661 --> 13:13.246
If you live near rivers,

13:13.247 --> 13:15.331
or live in any areas where there might be a mudslide...

13:15.916 --> 13:17.417
Oh, looks bad.

13:18.627 --> 13:20.545
I wonder how Mom is doing.

13:20.587 --> 13:22.005
She's fine!

13:22.047 --> 13:23.339
I'm sure she's fast asleep in a hotel bed.

13:24.299 --> 13:25.425
I'm sure.

13:38.710 --> 13:40.843
Sign: Yuichi

13:42.151 --> 13:43.317
Yuichi...

13:45.112 --> 13:46.112
Yup.

13:46.113 --> 13:49.407
That poor lady gave me this kendama.

13:49.408 --> 13:53.911
I asked her to stay at my place, but Sharaku got in my way.

13:53.912 --> 13:56.080
He's so rude!

14:08.686 --> 14:12.119
We're interrupting this program
to bring you breaking news.

14:12.226 --> 14:15.759
There was a mudslide near KR
Musashi station moments ago,

14:14.350 --> 14:16.434
What's the matter, Largo?

14:15.819 --> 14:17.612
and a train was washed off the track.

14:18.539 --> 14:19.539
I repeat.

14:20.246 --> 14:24.656
A train was derailed by a mudslide near KR Musashi station.

14:24.879 --> 14:28.392
There were no fatalities, but many are injured.

14:28.485 --> 14:31.592
We will keep you up to date as more reports come in.

14:28.864 --> 14:30.490
It's near that mountain path!

14:33.452 --> 14:34.118
Largo...

14:34.453 --> 14:35.411
Come, Largo!

14:37.873 --> 14:40.375
Doc! Where are you going?!

14:40.876 --> 14:46.530
With this torrential rain, we have received
reports of flooded houses and mudslides.

14:47.216 --> 14:50.968
Over 300 people are estimated as being
injured from the derailed train,

14:51.220 --> 14:55.181
and all of the hospitals in the area are
having difficulty meeting the demand.

15:00.938 --> 15:02.814
She must have walked from here.

15:02.815 --> 15:03.940
Let's go, Largo!

15:16.578 --> 15:17.662
I knew it.

15:19.039 --> 15:19.998
Lady!

15:20.582 --> 15:21.499
Lady!

15:22.209 --> 15:23.209
Lady!

15:27.506 --> 15:28.548
Where is she?

15:31.885 --> 15:32.844
Largo?

15:38.058 --> 15:39.058
Right here?

15:48.777 --> 15:49.944
Mom...

15:51.280 --> 15:53.197
Mom!

16:22.519 --> 16:23.186
What?!

16:29.026 --> 16:29.734
Lady?!

16:31.945 --> 16:35.448
Damn, she needs to be treated
at a nearby hospital very soon.

16:36.241 --> 16:39.619
No, I live in the town we just left.

16:39.662 --> 16:43.498
My son is a doctor.

16:46.710 --> 16:49.170
<i>Lady, I won't let you die.</i>

17:11.485 --> 17:13.528
Honey, can I bring in the next patient?

17:13.816 --> 17:14.862
Yeah.

17:16.281 --> 17:17.824
Who are you?!

17:18.659 --> 17:19.826
It's an emergency.

17:19.827 --> 17:21.077
It's critical.

17:21.286 --> 17:23.148
Don't come in without permission.

17:23.330 --> 17:26.082
Everyone else is waiting out there for their turn.

17:26.083 --> 17:28.876
It will be too late if you don't treat her immediately.

17:28.919 --> 17:31.045
Everyone is in the same situation.

17:32.131 --> 17:34.757
All patients are equal.

17:34.800 --> 17:35.508
Wait.

17:35.634 --> 17:36.843
Are you the chairman?

17:36.844 --> 17:38.511
Yes, I am.

17:39.722 --> 17:42.306
What are you looking at, then?

17:47.271 --> 17:48.354
Mom!

17:50.024 --> 17:51.774
Mom! Why?!

17:51.817 --> 17:52.608
Hey!

17:52.985 --> 17:55.178
Do you know where she was?

17:55.601 --> 17:57.447
In the old vacation home on the mountain!

17:57.990 --> 18:00.745
The vacation home? But that place was already...

18:00.745 --> 18:03.119
It's because you chased her out of this place!

18:03.412 --> 18:05.163
But we had so many patients.

18:05.414 --> 18:06.414
That's right.

18:06.415 --> 18:07.165
Besides, we gave her money...

18:07.416 --> 18:10.126
That's why I'm asking, what are you looking at?!

18:12.004 --> 18:15.423
This happened because you're only looking
out for your work and yourselves.

18:15.966 --> 18:19.427
Were you really looking out for your mother?

18:30.439 --> 18:31.314
This is..

18:38.030 --> 18:39.614
Here, I'm done.

18:41.158 --> 18:42.742
It's my name!

18:43.535 --> 18:48.456
I picked your name, hoping that you would
grow up to be a kind-hearted person.

18:49.208 --> 18:52.001
Be a compassionate and kind-hearted person.

18:52.002 --> 18:52.835
Yeah!

18:56.840 --> 18:57.757
Mom...

18:59.468 --> 19:01.761
Honey, we need to treat her.

19:02.641 --> 19:03.429
That's right!

19:03.430 --> 19:04.764
We must, right now!

19:04.854 --> 19:06.618
No. You can't.

19:07.141 --> 19:09.745
You just said all patients were equal.

19:09.770 --> 19:10.853
Yeah, but...

19:10.854 --> 19:13.189
She is my mother!

19:13.691 --> 19:15.191
Your mother?

19:15.192 --> 19:16.463
Shame on you!

19:16.840 --> 19:18.528
I'll treat her elsewhere.

19:18.655 --> 19:19.862
Please wait!

19:19.863 --> 19:21.239
I'm sure you've heard the news!

19:21.240 --> 19:23.700
Other places would be full of injured patients, too!

19:23.993 --> 19:25.743
Then I will operate on her.

19:26.412 --> 19:28.121
Are you a doctor too?

19:28.287 --> 19:30.081
Yes, something like that.

19:30.249 --> 19:33.626
But I still can't let someone else
take care of my own mother.

19:33.627 --> 19:35.128
Now, would you hand her over?

19:35.337 --> 19:40.425
How dare you say that, after ignoring her all this time?

19:41.218 --> 19:42.301
50,000,000!

19:42.790 --> 19:44.554
Then you can have this patient.

19:45.597 --> 19:46.889
50,000,000?!

19:47.060 --> 19:48.057
Are you threatening me?

19:48.600 --> 19:53.146
To me, even 10,000,000,000 would be
a cheap price for my own mother'

19:57.860 --> 19:58.776
Fine.

19:59.246 --> 20:00.403
I'll get the money ready.

20:01.238 --> 20:02.071
Honey!

20:02.114 --> 20:03.072
This isn't a joke!

20:03.073 --> 20:04.115
That's excessive!

20:04.116 --> 20:05.741
Be quiet!

20:05.900 --> 20:06.909
Honey...

20:07.286 --> 20:09.203
You are absolutely right.

20:09.345 --> 20:12.248
I was not looking at what's important.

20:12.510 --> 20:14.500
It's so simple.

20:15.502 --> 20:19.380
There are things that are more
important than money in this world!

20:20.966 --> 20:23.051
Don't forget that feeling.

20:26.847 --> 20:28.306
This is an emergency operation.

20:28.307 --> 20:30.058
I will lead the operation.

20:34.063 --> 20:35.605
Who are you?

20:35.606 --> 20:37.440
My name is Black Jack.

20:38.067 --> 20:39.359
You mean, you're...

20:39.902 --> 20:40.759
Don't worry.

20:41.028 --> 20:42.195
I guarantee her safety.

20:46.825 --> 20:47.992
We're commencing the operation.

20:48.369 --> 20:49.202
Yes.

20:58.462 --> 21:00.171
You've improved, Pinoco-chan.

21:00.214 --> 21:02.298
I'm a genius with the kendama.

21:04.510 --> 21:06.302
What's the matter, Pinoco-chan?

21:06.303 --> 21:09.263
I was wondering what is going on with that kendama lady.

21:09.264 --> 21:10.306
Don't worry.

21:10.307 --> 21:11.849
I'm sure she's doing fine.

21:11.850 --> 21:13.142
Right, Largo?

21:14.937 --> 21:17.855
All right! Let's race to the bridge!

21:17.923 --> 21:19.273
Wait up!

21:32.621 --> 21:33.363
Yuichi.

21:34.248 --> 21:35.498
Yuichi.

21:37.668 --> 21:38.292
Mom.

21:38.752 --> 21:40.753
Mom! You're conscious!

21:41.046 --> 21:41.546
Mother!

21:42.460 --> 21:43.751
Mom, I'm sorry.

21:43.918 --> 21:44.818
I'm really sorry,

21:44.851 --> 21:46.445
Mother, I'm sorry.

21:56.645 --> 21:57.714
Mom, huh?

22:07.085 --> 22:19.040
I love you darling. If I can be united with you,

22:07.085 --> 22:19.040
daisukuyo anata to hitotsu ni nareru no nara

22:19.158 --> 22:24.157
I couldn't be happier...

22:19.158 --> 22:24.157
konna shiawase wa naiwa...

22:25.726 --> 22:31.195
I wanted to see you forever

22:25.726 --> 22:31.195
zutto aitakute mattetano

22:31.739 --> 22:37.197
I'm laying on the grill,

22:31.739 --> 22:37.197
ami no ue ni yasashiku nekasete

22:37.801 --> 22:40.286
being heated up by you,

22:37.801 --> 22:40.286
anata ni hoterasarete

22:40.495 --> 22:48.272
so much that I change color

22:40.495 --> 22:48.272
atashi wa iro ga kawarukurai

22:48.357 --> 23:00.126
I dress up with sparkly grains of decorations

22:48.357 --> 23:00.126
kirakira hikaru tsubu no kazari de oshare

23:00.334 --> 23:12.065
I love you darling. Please love me more and more...

23:00.334 --> 23:12.065
daisukiyo motto motto atashi wo aishite

23:12.305 --> 23:23.656
I love you darling. If I can be united with you,

23:12.305 --> 23:23.656
daisukiyo anata to hitotsu no nareru no nara

23:23.842 --> 23:28.763
I couldn't be happier

23:23.842 --> 23:28.763
konna shiawase wa naiwa...

23:28.991 --> 23:33.925
How does it taste?

23:28.991 --> 23:33.924
oaji wa ikaga?

23:45.067 --> 24:15.070
Legend of the Phoenix

23:45.187 --> 23:46.187
Doctor...

23:46.960 --> 23:48.961
The patient is a 200-year-old man.

23:49.367 --> 23:50.363
Nonsense...

23:50.387 --> 23:53.347
There's a legend of a phoenix in this region.

23:53.706 --> 23:55.349
That's only a fairy tale.

23:56.900 --> 23:58.893
It's the phoefenix!

23:59.337 --> 24:02.008
You'd start a new business with the phoenix's blood?

24:02.461 --> 24:03.214
Yes.

24:03.734 --> 24:05.467
It will bring in millions.

24:05.861 --> 24:07.308
In that cave...

24:10.118 --> 24:13.105
Next karte - Legend of the Phoenix

24:15.605 --> 24:17.481
Pinoco's diary...

24:18.725 --> 24:19.672
Are you threatening me?

24:20.313 --> 24:24.601
To me, even 10,000,000,000 would
be a cheap price for my own mother!
